    <briefdescription>
<para>Folder with C++ header files for the µTest++ Testing Framework. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This folder holds the headers included by the primary public header, <computeroutput><ref refid="micro-test-plus_8h" kindref="compound">micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus.h</ref></computeroutput>, which is the only one that the applications include.</para>
<para>Most of the headers declare what the applications use: the runner (<computeroutput><ref refid="runner_8h" kindref="compound">runner.h</ref></computeroutput>) and its options (<computeroutput><ref refid="runner-options_8h" kindref="compound">runner-options.h</ref></computeroutput>), the test suites and test cases (<computeroutput><ref refid="test_8h" kindref="compound">test.h</ref></computeroutput>), the counters (<computeroutput><ref refid="counters_8h" kindref="compound">counters.h</ref></computeroutput>), the function comparators (<computeroutput><ref refid="function-comparators_8h" kindref="compound">function-comparators.h</ref></computeroutput>), the exception checks (<computeroutput><ref refid="exceptions_8h" kindref="compound">exceptions.h</ref></computeroutput>), the string utilities (<computeroutput><ref refid="utility_8h" kindref="compound">utility.h</ref></computeroutput>), the concepts and templates for the application extensions (<computeroutput><ref refid="extension_8h" kindref="compound">extension.h</ref></computeroutput>), the formatter of the operand values (<computeroutput><ref refid="expression-formatter_8h" kindref="compound">expression-formatter.h</ref></computeroutput>), and the deprecated definitions (<computeroutput><ref refid="deprecated_8h" kindref="compound">deprecated.h</ref></computeroutput>).</para>
<para>The other headers belong to the implementation, in the <computeroutput>detail</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>reflection</computeroutput> namespaces, and the applications do not need to name their contents: the check results (<computeroutput><ref refid="check-result_8h" kindref="compound">check-result.h</ref></computeroutput>), the reporters (<computeroutput><ref refid="reporter_8h" kindref="compound">reporter.h</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="reporter-human_8h" kindref="compound">reporter-human.h</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="reporter-tap_8h" kindref="compound">reporter-tap.h</ref></computeroutput>), the shared templates (<computeroutput><ref refid="detail_8h" kindref="compound">detail.h</ref></computeroutput>), the source location (<computeroutput><ref refid="reflection_8h" kindref="compound">reflection.h</ref></computeroutput>), the mathematical helpers (<computeroutput><ref refid="math_8h" kindref="compound">math.h</ref></computeroutput>), and the stopwatch (<computeroutput><ref refid="stopwatch_8h" kindref="compound">stopwatch.h</ref></computeroutput>).</para>
<para>The definitions of the inline functions and of the templates are in the <computeroutput>inlines</computeroutput> subfolder, and the non-inline definitions in the <computeroutput>src</computeroutput> folder.  </para>
    </detaileddescription>
